  "question": {
    "text": "Calculate the resulting temperature when <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> of boiling water is poured into an ice-cold brass vessel (specific heat = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0.1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>cal</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>°</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> ) of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math>."
  },
